#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:2 61e90c21521b4617b0163c867adf038f
msgid "_`Positioning an axis`"
msgstr ""
"_`轴的定位`"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:4 664ff418e0eb4ad78d709cb4f9a7ad70
msgid ""
"The task: move a joint to a position, inside a window it must never "
"leave, fast enough to be useful and gently enough not to excite the "
"mechanics."
msgstr ""
"任务：把一个关节移动到某个位置，落在它绝不能越出的窗口内，快到有用，轻到"
"不激起机械振动。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:8 33fa0dc8ec224288b0fe184202247efc
msgid "What you need"
msgstr ""
"所需部件"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:10
#: 4dae381f93f0441b886a46ff256212ba
msgid ""
"``foc/core/soft_limit.hpp`` -- admit or refuse a target. Refusing is the "
"whole point: a limit that clamps instead hands the loop a position it was"
" never asked for."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/soft_limit.hpp`` ——接受或拒绝一个目标。拒绝才是全部要点：会做"
"钳位的限位反而把一个从未被要求的位置交给环。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:13
#: 852ddd879c2940808ad078997c9f0711
msgid ""
"``foc/core/motion_profile.hpp`` -- shape a velocity command for the "
"remaining error, under a velocity and an acceleration ceiling."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/motion_profile.hpp`` ——在速度上限与加速度上限之下，为剩余误差"
"塑形速度指令。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:15
#: 810680b345894a09a56b519815f47180
msgid ""
"``foc/core/position.hpp`` -- the P law that turns a position error into a"
" velocity or torque command."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/position.hpp`` ——把位置误差变成速度指令或转矩指令的 P 律。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:17
#: 26874d25794146ca8aa5eef15b7e859f
msgid ""
"``foc/core/position_reference.hpp`` -- unwraps the encoder and defines "
"the origin; the first sample is the origin, which is why an axis without "
"homing has an arbitrary one."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/position_reference.hpp`` ——展开编码器并定义原点；第一个采样就"
"是原点，这就是没有回零的轴原点任意的原因。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:20
#: 2e8a137ad9904ed9b569e21faff9cd55
msgid ""
"``foc/core/homing.hpp`` -- finds a real origin, so the numbers mean "
"something after a power cycle."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/homing.hpp`` ——寻找真实原点，使数字在一次上下电之后仍然有意义"
"。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:22
#: d4996e033c7b484982425c5aa33c778e
msgid ""
"``foc/core/gear_ratio.hpp`` -- one master angle in, a slave target and a "
"slave velocity reference out."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/gear_ratio.hpp`` ——进一个主轴角度，出从轴目标与从轴速度参考。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:26
#: 3ec0f6a11dc44b4e94c43a10f2e764ec
msgid "A minimal program"
msgstr ""
"最小程序"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:28
#: 29de4b2db4ca4911a3e012854f422e8a
msgid ""
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/positioning.cxx`` shows the two refusals, "
"one gear sample and one shaped move. The same file produces this slice's "
"figure."
msgstr ""
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/positioning.cxx`` 演示两次拒绝、一个传动"
"比采样和一次带塑形的移动。本切片的图也由同一个文件产生。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:37
#: 5ff3485987134c25ba72b4e70c441d04
msgid ""
"The output to read first is the refusal: a target of ``1.5`` rad against "
"a window of ``[-1.0, 1.0]`` comes back as ``Param`` **and** as the "
"previous target. A caller that ignores the status goes on commanding the "
"old position, and the axis holding still looks exactly like an axis that "
"arrived."
msgstr ""
"首先要读的输出是那次拒绝：对窗口 ``[-1.0, 1.0]`` 而言 ``1.5`` rad 的目标"
"，返回的是 ``Param`` **以及** 上一个目标。忽略状态的调用方会继续命令旧位"
"置，而静止不动的轴看起来与已经到位的轴一模一样。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:43
#: 8af96d98d665488c8b5a9622e7b6263a
msgid "Where the numbers come from"
msgstr ""
"数字的来源"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:45
#: e0c45a2893fc47ffad15ed2856c30581
msgid ""
"**The window** comes from the mechanics, not from the controller: where "
"the axis physically may go. The walls are inclusive, so \"move to the "
"limit\" is a command the limit can accept."
msgstr ""
"**窗口** 来自机械，而不是控制器：轴在物理上能去的地方。两壁是闭区间，因"
"此“移动到极限”是限位可以接受的命令。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:48
#: 9b66a997f10f4a96892da29d6c8d803c
msgid ""
"**The acceleration ceiling** is what the mechanics and the current limit "
"allow. **The velocity ceiling** is usually the same number times a time "
"constant; it exists so a large error cannot ask for a speed the loop "
"cannot stop from."
msgstr ""
"**加速度上限** 由机械与电流限幅决定。 **速度上限** 通常是同一个数乘一个"
"时间常数；它存在的目的，是不让一个大误差要求一个环停不下来的转速。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:51
#: 2c7e1db8d56d4848ab38674a87258950
msgid ""
"**The shaping gain** has the dimension of a bandwidth (velocity per "
"radian of error, 1/s), and it is the one number here that a user tunes. "
"It is not the same knob as the position loop's gain: the profile shapes "
"the command, the loop follows it."
msgstr ""
"**塑形增益** 的量纲是带宽（每弧度误差对应的速度，1/s），也是这里唯一由使"
"用者整定的数。它与位置环的增益不是同一个旋钮：轮廓塑形指令，环跟随指令。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:55
#: b85423f4667b4d8a9bdbe87a5368665e
msgid ""
"**The gear ratio and offset** come from the mechanics; the offset is the "
"slave position at master zero, so it is a measurement, not a preference."
msgstr ""
"**传动比与偏置** 来自机械；偏置是主轴为零时从轴的位置，所以它是一次测量"
"，不是一项偏好。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:59
#: e0285bd895a643bebcc4b683b98cb6e0
msgid "How it goes wrong"
msgstr ""
"失效方式"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:61
#: 8c77c6396c404d769b87e99eacca2322
msgid ""
"**The refusal is ignored.** ``Param`` plus the previous target is a safe "
"answer only if the caller reads the status; otherwise the axis parks and "
"the application believes it is moving. Check the status on every call, "
"not the target value."
msgstr ""
"**拒绝被忽略。** ``Param`` 加上上一个目标，只有在调用方读取状态时才是安"
"全的答复；否则轴停住，而应用以为它在移动。每次调用都要检查状态，而不是检"
"查目标值。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:65
#: 2d2a8c7ac9f141d1981395b26850ff73
msgid ""
"**A gear without the velocity reference.** A position loop told only "
"where to be lags a moving target by ``v * kd / kp``; on a geared pair "
"that lag is a synchronisation error that no gain increase fixes without "
"also raising the noise. Feed the slave velocity forward."
msgstr ""
"**只有位置、没有速度参考的传动。** 只被告知该在哪里的位置环，会以 ``v *"
"kd / kp`` 的量滞后于运动目标；在传动副上，这个滞后是同步误差，靠提高增益"
"修不好，除非同时抬高噪声。把从轴速度前馈进去。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:69
#: 246f897822c44b94951bed389cdd0661
msgid ""
"**An origin nobody defined.** ``position_reference`` defines the origin "
"from the first sample, so an axis that never homed has a legal but "
"arbitrary zero. Everything downstream -- soft limits included -- is then "
"measured from the wrong place."
msgstr ""
"**没人定义过的原点。** ``position_reference`` 用第一个采样定义原点，因此"
"从未回零的轴有一个合法但任意的零点。下游的一切——包括软限位——于是都从错误"
"的地方量起。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:73
#: 10ef0e0b8aab4b69ae66e99f1992d879
msgid ""
"**Shaping treated as the loop.** The profile limits how fast the "
"*command* moves; it says nothing about the axis. A profile tuned to the "
"acceleration limit with a loop that cannot track it produces a shaped "
"command and an unshaped motion."
msgstr ""
"**把塑形当成环。** 轮廓限制的是 *指令* 移动的速度；它对轴一无所言。把轮"
"廓调到加速度上限，而环跟不上它，得到的是一个被塑形的指令和一段没有被塑形"
"的运动。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:79
#: 226dd4d67273419ca5fb8e3730001617
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr ""
"证据"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:81
#: a4b7c7179c784a27a2443d6ee34440aa
msgid ""
"Six claim rows cover this slice -- ``soft_limit``, ``motion_profile``, "
"``position``, ``position_reference``, ``homing`` and ``gear_ratio`` -- "
"and the level this page may state is the minimum of those six. The levels"
" themselves are read from the claim table in the project ``README.md``."
msgstr ""
"六条主张行覆盖本切片—— ``soft_limit`` 、 ``motion_profile`` 、 ``"
"position`` 、 ``position_reference`` 、 ``homing`` 和 ``gear_ratio`` ——"
"本页可以陈述的等级是这六条中的最小值。等级本身从项目 ``README.md`` 的主"
"张表读取。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:87
#: 14b5f589c2be416682964eaa8b651345
msgid "Figure"
msgstr ""
"图"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:94
#: e9b5c75e2143478880f87669278b940e
msgid ""
"one move shaped by an acceleration limit: the velocity command ramps up "
"at the ceiling, then decays as the error shrinks, and the position "
"converges to the target without overshoot"
msgstr ""
"一次由加速度上限塑形的移动：速度指令在上限处斜坡上升，随后随误差收缩而衰"
"减，位置无超调地收敛到目标"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s6-position.rst:98
#: b71ab2457428466aa3eaf01265d9b758
msgid ""
"The figure is produced by ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` from this page's"
" own example. The axis behind it is an integrator, so the curve shows the"
" **shape** of the command and the settling of a first-order approach -- "
"not the dynamics of a motor, which the SIL demos carry."
msgstr ""
"图由 ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` 从本页自己的示例生成。它背后的轴是一"
"个积分器，因此曲线展示的是指令的 **形状** 和一阶趋近的收敛过程——不是电机"
"的动态，后者由 SIL 示例承载。"

